<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Two die at S.Africa's Freegold mine.</title>
<headline>Two die at S.Africa's Freegold mine.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two workers died in an underground accident at Free State Consolidated Gold Mines Ltd's 3 North Shaft on Sunday, mine manager Anglogold said on Tursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The circumstances of the accident are being investigated but it would appear that the men fell while in the process of clearing a travelling way blocked by broken ore,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
